				<td colspan="2"><span class="postbody">First of all you need to have you picture for your tag store on the internet. Its URL will look something like:
<br />
</span><table width="90%" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3" border="0" align="center"><tr> 	  <td><span class="genmed"><b>Code:</b></span></td>	</tr>	<tr>	  <td class="code">http&#58;//www.photobucket.com/~bumdail/sigpic.jpg</td>	</tr></table><span class="postbody">
<br />

<br />
Open you profile and type in </span><table width="90%" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3" border="0" align="center"><tr> 	  <td><span class="genmed"><b>Code:</b></span></td>	</tr>	<tr>	  <td class="code">&#91;img&#93;</td>	</tr></table><span class="postbody">, then type in your image URL and finally type in </span><table width="90%" cellspacing="1" cellpadding="3" border="0" align="center"><tr> 	  <td><span class="genmed"><b>Code:</b></span></td>	</tr>	<tr>	  <td class="code">&#91;/img&#93;</td>	</tr></table><span class="postbody">
<br />

<br />
Save it. Now your posts will have your signature image on them.
<br />

<br />
One suggestion about the signature ... try to keep the files near the 30K mark (certainly not 300K) and it should be about 600 x 200 pixels. Not everyone has the benefit of (i) ADSL and (ii) the website hosting you image may have bandwidth restrictions.<br />_________________<br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=639173" target="_blank" class="postlink">Vlar Hellar</a>, Shadow Knight
